Warning sign number two is flood damage.

150
00:05:17,093 --> 00:05:18,789
On October thirteenth,

151
00:05:18,789 --> 00:05:23,262
twenty twenty-six, Carfax estimated that about forty-eight

152
00:05:23,262 --> 00:05:26,501
thousand vehicles may have been damaged by

153
00:05:26,501 --> 00:05:29,662
flooding from storms earlier in the year,

154
00:05:29,662 --> 00:05:31,590
between April and August,

155
00:05:31,590 --> 00:05:33,827
in states including Michigan,

156
00:05:33,827 --> 00:05:37,682
Wisconsin, Mississippi, Indiana and West Virginia,

157
00:05:37,682 --> 00:05:40,150
according to Carrier Management.

158
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:42,544
And those are only the new ones.

159
00:05:42,724 --> 00:05:46,502
More than half a million water-damaged vehicles

160
00:05:46,502 --> 00:05:47,948
were already on U.

161
00:05:48,128 --> 00:05:48,523
S.

162
00:05:48,703 --> 00:05:50,783
roads before these storms,

163
00:05:50,783 --> 00:05:52,383
according to Carfax.

164
00:05:52,563 --> 00:05:53,655
Half a million.

165
00:05:53,835 --> 00:05:56,586
Some were repaired properly and disclosed.

166
00:05:56,766 --> 00:05:59,216
Many were simply cleaned up and sold.

167
00:05:59,396 --> 00:06:02,055
Carfax's chief product officer,

168
00:06:02,055 --> 00:06:03,856
Paul Nadjarian, said,

169
00:06:03,856 --> 00:06:07,801
quote, floodwater can leave behind damage that

170
00:06:07,801 --> 00:06:11,060
