178
00:06:24,703 --> 00:06:26,159
the flooding happened.

179
00:06:26,339 --> 00:06:30,001
A truck that went underwater in Mississippi

180
00:06:30,001 --> 00:06:31,024
can be sold,

181
00:06:31,024 --> 00:06:32,387
clean and shiny,

182
00:06:32,387 --> 00:06:34,431
