183
00:06:34,611 --> 00:06:36,820
So the question is not whether your

184
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:37,641
area flooded.

185
00:06:37,821 --> 00:06:39,412
It is where the truck has been.

186
00:06:39,761 --> 00:06:42,169
Why is flood damage so bad for

187
00:06:42,169 --> 00:06:43,372
