190
00:06:49,616 --> 00:06:51,910
many of them low in the body

191
00:06:51,910 --> 00:06:53,467
or under the seats.

192
00:06:53,647 --> 00:06:56,443
Water and silt can cause corrosion that

193
00:06:56,443 --> 00:06:58,163
takes months to show up.

194
00:06:58,343 --> 00:07:00,408
A truck can seem fine on the

195
00:07:00,408 --> 00:07:03,725
