211
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:36,312
under the seats,

212
00:07:36,312 --> 00:07:37,865
or in odd places.

213
00:07:38,045 --> 00:07:40,565
Brittle wiring under the dashboard.

214
00:07:40,745 --> 00:07:44,044
And fog or moisture inside the headlights,

215
00:07:44,044 --> 00:07:46,793
taillights or the instrument panel.

216
00:07:47,143 --> 00:07:48,757
And use the free tools.

217
00:07:48,937 --> 00:07:51,928
Carfax offers a free flood check by

218
00:07:51,928 --> 00:07:52,269
VIN.

219
00:07:52,449 --> 00:07:55,361
A history report may show a flood

220
00:07:55,361 --> 00:07:56,861
or salvage title.

221
00:07:57,041 --> 00:07:58,585
But here is the honest limit.

222
00:07:58,765 --> 00:08:01,192
If a truck was flooded and never

223
00:08:01,192 --> 00:08:02,860
